# HubbleSpace — environment variables
#
# REQUIRED for local development only:
#   VITE_BASE44_APP_ID — the Base44 app id (6ade2063a43a5acbc2adbd10).
#   On `base44 build` / deployment this is injected automatically; you only
#   need it for `npm run dev` against the live backend.
VITE_BASE44_APP_ID=

# OPTIONAL backend secrets (Base44 dashboard → Secrets, or `base44 secrets set`),
# only needed if you enable the corresponding backend feature:
#   AGENTMAIL_WEBHOOK_SECRET / AGENTMAIL_API_KEY — inbound email to spaces
#     (agentmailWebhook is currently a stub; the demo doesn't need it).
#   AI answers (voice-deal, ask-the-space) run through Base44's built-in
#     InvokeLLM — no key needed.

# NOT needed for the demo:
#   - No web-scraping keys (link enrichment stubs stay off).
#   - No email keys (inbound email is stubbed).
#   - No LLM key (InvokeLLM is built in).
#   - Legacy Convex vars are gone: CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT / VITE_CONVEX_URL are
#     no longer read by the app.

# Demo data:
#   node scripts/seed-demo.mjs        — wipe + reseed the two demo spaces
#   node scripts/seed-demo.mjs --wipe — wipe only
